    "Worktrees are available for Git repositories": "工作樹僅適用於 Git 儲存庫",
    "(Preview & Quota Heavy) Run a swarm: several agents working in parallel on one task, each in its own conversation, collaborating through a shared message board. Use when the work splits into pieces that can be done at the same time, or when a second pair of eyes should check the first pair's work.": "（預覽功能，耗用大量額度）執行代理群：多個代理同時處理同一個任務，各自在自己的對話中，透過共用留言板協作。適合工作能拆成可同時進行的部分，或需要另一組代理檢查前一組成果時使用。",
    "Automatically migrate legacy workflows to modern skills across global and workspace configurations. Scans for existing workflows, creates target SKILL.md files, and safely archives old workflow files.": "自動把全域與工作區設定中的舊版工作流程轉換成新版技能：掃描現有工作流程、建立對應的 SKILL.md，並安全地封存舊的工作流程檔。",
    "Discover UI plugin panels relevant to the current task and surface a one-click pill in chat to open (toggle) them in the side pane. Use when a running UI plugin's panel would help with what the user is doing, or right after the user enables a new UI plugin pane and a shortcut to open it is handy.": "找出與目前任務相關的介面外掛面板，並在對話中顯示一鍵按鈕，可在側邊窗格開啟或關閉它。適合執行中的介面外掛面板對使用者正在做的事有幫助，或使用者剛啟用新的介面外掛面板、需要快速開啟時使用。",
    "Guidelines for interacting with GitHub and request permissions from the user when commands fail due to restrictions in the agent environment.": "與 GitHub 互動的準則；當指令因代理環境的限制而失敗時，向使用者請求權限。",
    "How to render rich interactive HTML widgets inline in the chat or as standalone artifacts. Use this skill when you want to show the user diagrams, data visualizations, interactive controls, educational walkthroughs, or any rich visual content beyond plain text and markdown.": "說明如何在對話中或以獨立成品呈現互動式 HTML 元件。想給使用者看圖表、資料視覺化、互動控制項、教學導覽，或任何超出純文字與 Markdown 的視覺內容時使用。",
    "Interactive guide to design and create a scheduled background automation. Use this skill when the user wants to create an automated or recurring scheduled task (e.g. \"summarize my emails every morning\", \"every Monday send me a to-do list\"). Also triggered by the /automation slash command.": "互動式引導，協助設計並建立排程的背景自動化。使用者想建立自動或定期執行的任務時使用（例如「每天早上摘要我的郵件」、「每週一寄待辦清單給我」）。也可用 /automation 斜線指令啟動。",
    "ONLY for the native-swarm worker whose brief says it is the monitor. On a timer, it checks whether the whole swarm has stalled and calls on the one member who can unstick it. Coordinators and other workers: do not load this.": "僅供任務說明中指定為監控者的代理群成員使用。它會定時檢查整個代理群是否停滯，並找能解開卡關的那位成員處理。協調者與其他成員請勿載入。",
